			<h5>문무대왕릉 관람정보<a class="viewBtn" href="/tour/page.do?listType=&amp;mnu_uid=2294&amp;sortKwd=&amp;code_uid=1016&amp;srchKwd=&amp;area_uid=152&amp;cmd=2" target="_blank">상세보기</a></h5>

			<ul class="dept1">
